# Godot 4+ specific ignores
.godot/
.nomedia

# Build output from tools/export_web.sh
build/

# Godot-specific ignores
.import/
export.cfg
export_credentials.cfg
*.tmp

# Imported translations (automatically generated from CSV files)
*.translation

# Mono-specific ignores
.mono/
data_*/
mono_crash.*.json

# NOTE: *.uid and *.import files are deliberately NOT ignored.
#
#   *.uid     Godot 4.4+ writes a stable resource identity next to each script
#             and resource. Ignoring them makes Godot mint new UIDs per clone,
#             which breaks `uid://` references between files.
#   *.import  Import settings for each asset. Without them a fresh clone cannot
#             load its own textures until someone runs an editor/import pass.
#
# Both are engine-generated but belong in version control.
